{
  "description": "The creature is a single four-legged equid shown in right-facing profile against a plain off-white background. It has a stocky, donkey-like body with a shaggy brownish-gray coat that is lighter on the belly and white around the muzzle and nostrils, a short erect dark mane along the back of the neck, two large upright ears, and a thin tail with a dark tuft at the tip. Dark brown to black striping overlays much of the body, most prominently on the hindquarters, mid-back, shoulder, neck and lower legs, with a continuous dark dorsal stripe along the spine and a vertical shoulder stripe. It stands with all four legs visible in a natural standing pose.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "elongated donkey-like head with a broad forehead, white fur around the nose and mouth, a large dark nostril, a dark eye with a pale ring around it, and coarse brown fur with a slightly shaggy texture",
      "where": "at the front right end of the body, attached to the neck and facing to the right in profile"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "two large, upright, pointed ears with dark outer edges and lighter inner fur, the inner surface showing dark markings",
      "where": "on top of the head, one slightly behind the other in profile view"
    },
    {
      "part": "mane",
      "looks_like": "short, stiff, bristly mane of dark brown to black hair standing erect, with a slightly striped or banded appearance",
      "where": "along the dorsal side of the neck from just behind the ears to the shoulders"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four slender ungulate legs with shaggy upper portions and more tightly striped lower portions, the hind legs slightly bent at the hock",
      "where": "beneath the body, two forelegs under the chest and two hind legs under the rump"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "four single-toed dark hooves, rounded with a flat sole, typical of an equid",
      "where": "at the bottom tip of each leg, in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "a thin tail with short hair at the base and longer dark brown to black hair forming a tuft at the tip, hanging straight down",
      "where": "extending from the rear of the rump at the left side of the image"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "dark transverse stripes of varying width and intensity across the hindquarters, back, sides, shoulder, neck and lower legs, plus a prominent dark dorsal stripe running along the midline of the back and a dark vertical shoulder stripe encircling the front of the torso",
      "where": "distributed over the torso, hindquarters, neck, and legs, with the dorsal stripe on the spine and the shoulder stripe just behind the mane"
    }
  ],
